@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Run AI Analysis Task
top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 14
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8C6
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 12
}

note top
Steps:
1) Choose asset/corpus + task type
2) Assemble context
3) Run AI pipeline
4) If failure, save failure + error details
5) If success, compute confidence/metrics
6) Create TaskResult + EvidenceRefs
7) Notify user (Ready or Failed)
end note

(*) --> "1. Choose asset/corpus\n+ task type"
--> "2. Assemble context"
--> "3. Run AI pipeline"
--> "Success?"

if (Success?) then (Yes)
  --> "5. Compute\nconfidence/metrics"
  --> "6. Create TaskResult\n+ EvidenceRefs"
  --> "7. Notify user\n(Ready)"
else
  --> "4. Save failure\n+ error details"
  --> "7. Notify user\n(Failed)"
endif

--> (*)

@enduml